# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Money Mngr PWA - Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# === Google Sheets — Backup & Auto-Sync (Server-side) ===
# Required for backup/restore AND Phase 1.5 auto-sync
# Create one master Google Spreadsheet and paste its ID below.
# The service account must have Editor access to that spreadsheet.
# See SETUP.md for step-by-step instructions.
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL=your-service-account@your-project.iam.gserviceaccount.com
GOOGLE_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n"
GOOGLE_SPREADSHEET_ID=your-spreadsheet-id-here
# GOOGLE_SHEETS_SPREADSHEET_ID is an alias for GOOGLE_SPREADSHEET_ID (same value)
GOOGLE_SHEETS_SPREADSHEET_ID=your-spreadsheet-id-here

# === Google OAuth (required for login) ===
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret

# === Google Drive (for snapshots - optional) ===
# Enable the Google Drive API in your Google Cloud Console
# Uses the same service account as Google Sheets

# === NextAuth ===
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=generate-with-openssl-rand-base64-32
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000

# === Developer AI Fallback Keys (server-side only, NOT NEXT_PUBLIC) ===
# Used as a last resort after all 3 user slots are exhausted.
# Never exposed to the browser. Provider is auto-detected from key prefix:
#   AIza... → Gemini   |   sk-ant-... → Claude   |   sk-... → OpenAI
AI_DEV_KEY_1=
AI_DEV_KEY_2=

# === Legacy LLM keys (deprecated — replaced by user slot system above) ===
# These are no longer read by FAIN routes. Keep for reference only.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_OPENAI_API_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLAUDE_API_KEY=

# === App Settings ===
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME="Money Mngr"
